<Programs Use="Context">
<Program Use="Context" Name="MainProgram">
<Tags Use="Context">
<Tag Name="Address" TagType="Base" DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Constant="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Temp Address used in Time Loop]]>
</Description>
<Data Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[9]]>
</Data>
<Data Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Value="9"/>
</Data>
</Tag>
<Tag Name="Index" TagType="Base" DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Constant="false" ExternalAccess="Read/Write">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Index]]>
</Description>
<Data Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[2]]>
</Data>
<Data Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Value="2"/>
</Data>
</Tag>
</Tags>
<Routines Use="Context">
<Routine Use="Target" Name="Time_Loop" Type="RLL">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Timer Routine]]>
</Description>
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[==========================================================================================================================================================
                                                                                                             Time_Loop : Manage the timers (indexed routine from Time)

                                                    List of treatments handled by the routine :
                                                         - Reset timers
                                                         - Calculating the timers values
                                                    -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                    History 
		2019-DEC-24 - Merck - Q. Spindler - Initial version for Candidate Release 1.00.00.00.a
==========================================================================================================================================================]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Reset timers
==========================================================================================================================================================
Clear the timer based on reset flag status.  Reset All does not reset the procedure timers (index 19), they are reset only by the Reset Procedure flag.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Timers[Index].Reset) ,XIC(TimerControl.ResetAll) NEQ(Index,19) ,XIC(TimerControl.ResetProcedure) EQU(Index,19) ][CLR(Timers[Index].TotalSeconds) ,CLR(Timers[Index].Seconds) ,CLR(Timers[Index].Minutes) ,CLR(Timers[Index].Hours) ,OTU(Timers[Index].Reset) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Calculating the timers values
==========================================================================================================================================================
Incement the seconds value each second if the timer is enabled.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(TimerControl.Tick)XIC(Timers[Index].Enable)[ADD(Timers[Index].TotalSeconds,1,Timers[Index].TotalSeconds) ,ADD(Timers[Index].Seconds,1,Timers[Index].Seconds) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[If the seconds value is 60, clear it and increment the minutes value.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(Timers[Index].Seconds,60)[CLR(Timers[Index].Seconds) ,ADD(Timers[Index].Minutes,1,Timers[Index].Minutes) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[If the minutes value is 60, clear it and increment the hours value.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQU(Timers[Index].Minutes,60)[CLR(Timers[Index].Minutes) ,ADD(Timers[Index].Hours,1,Timers[Index].Hours) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Convert the hours, minutes and seconds integer values to string values.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[DTOS(Timers[Index].Hours,Timers[Index].sHours) ,DTOS(Timers[Index].Minutes,Timers[Index].sMinutes) ,DTOS(Timers[Index].Seconds,Timers[Index].sSeconds) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Concatenate the hours, minutes and seconds strings values and colon to create the format HH:MM:SS.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[EQU(Timers[Index].sMinutes.LEN,1) CONCAT(Timers[Index].sHours,TimerControl.ColonZero,Timers[Index].HMS) ,EQU(Timers[Index].sMinutes.LEN,2) CONCAT(Timers[Index].sHours,TimerControl.Colon,Timers[Index].HMS) ,CONCAT(Timers[Index].HMS,Timers[Index].sMinutes,Timers[Index].HMS) ,EQU(Timers[Index].sSeconds.LEN,1) CONCAT(Timers[Index].HMS,TimerControl.ColonZero,Timers[Index].HMS) ,EQU(Timers[Index].sSeconds.LEN,2) CONCAT(Timers[Index].HMS,TimerControl.Colon,Timers[Index].HMS) ,CONCAT(Timers[Index].HMS,Timers[Index].sSeconds,Timers[Index].HMS) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Set the null terminator.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[[MOV(Timers[Index].HMS.LEN,Address) ,MOV(9,Address) ] ,CLR(Timers[Index].HMS.DATA[Address]) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
</Routines>
</Program>
</Programs>
</Controller>
</RSLogix5000Content>
